  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1901.33 Used vehicle",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-09-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1901.33 \"Used vehicle\" means a vehicle previously titled or registered by the state of New Hampshire, another state, or the federal government. The term includes vehicles that have been deemed to be abandoned.\n\nSource. #8339, eff 4-26-05 (from Saf-C 1902.24); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22 (from Saf-C 1901.30)\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23 (formerly Saf-C 1901.29)",
